WEBVTT

00:11:25.662 --> 00:11:31.871
But they did not prevent anyone who has
made a movie from getting, you know,

00:11:31.912 --> 00:11:37.246
the sort of laurels that their artistic
accomplishment may have earned them.

00:11:37.246 --> 00:11:39.412
And that's the thing like, look,
for me personally,

00:11:39.412 --> 00:11:45.246
I don't need for any individual movie
to include black people. Right.

00:11:45.371 --> 00:11:49.246
Or any other group. If you want to make
a movie with all like made by

00:11:49.246 --> 00:11:51.912
and about all straight white men over

00:11:51.912 --> 00:11:55.162
the age of 50 who grew up upper middle
class, like more power to you.

00:11:55.746 --> 00:11:58.454
I just want to make sure that
if somebody wants to make

00:11:58.454 --> 00:12:02.912
a movie about trans women
who are black and poor,